{"title": "Quant Super Practice — Mock #95", "duration_min": 20.0, "questions": [{"q_en": "<p>If 7cos x - sec x = 4&radic;3 . cos x, then find the value of (cos<sup>2</sup> x  -  7).</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 7cos x - sec x = 4&radic;3 . cos x &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; (cos<sup>2</sup> x - 7) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["2&radic;3", "&radic;3", "8&radic;3", "4&radic;3"], "options_hi": ["2&radic;3", "&radic;3", "8&radic;3", "4&radic;3"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>7cos x - sec x = 4&radic;3 . cos x</p><p>=&gt; 7cos<sup>2</sup> x - 1 = 4&radic;3 cos<sup>2</sup> x</p><p>=&gt; (7  -  4&radic;3) cos<sup>2</sup> x = 1</p><p>=&gt; cos<sup>2</sup> x = 1/(7  -  4&radic;3) * (7 + 4&radic;3)/(7 + 4&radic;3)</p><p>=&gt; cos<sup>2</sup> x = 7 + 4&radic;3</p><p>=&gt; (cos<sup>2</sup> x  -  7) = 4&radic;3</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>7cos x - sec x = 4&radic;3 . cos x</p><p>=&gt; 7cos<sup>2</sup> x - 1 = 4&radic;3 cos<sup>2</sup> x</p><p>=&gt; (7  -  4&radic;3) cos<sup>2</sup> x = 1</p><p>=&gt; cos<sup>2</sup> x = 1/(7  -  4&radic;3) * (7 + 4&radic;3)/(7 + 4&radic;3)</p><p>=&gt; cos<sup>2</sup> x = 7 + 4&radic;3</p><p>=&gt; (cos<sup>2</sup> x  -  7) = 4&radic;3</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If A is an acute angle and sec A = cosec A, then find the value of 2sin<sup>2</sup>A +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">tan<sup>2</sup>A", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; A &#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2381;&#2351;&#2370;&#2344; &#2325;&#2379;&#2339; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; sec A = cosec A &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; 2sin<sup>2</sup>A + <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">tan<sup>2</sup>A", "options_en": ["11/6", "12/5", "13/4", "10/3"], "options_hi": ["11/6", "12/5", "13/4", "10/3"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Since A is an acute angle and secA = cosecA, therefore A = 45&deg;</p><p>Now,</p><p>2sin<sup>2</sup>A + [(tan<sup>2</sup>A)/3]  -  cos<sup>2</sup>A + 1</p><p>= 2sin<sup>2</sup>45&deg; + [(tan<sup>2</sup>45&deg;)/3]  -  cos<sup>2</sup>45&deg; + 1</p><p>= 2 * (1/2) + (1/3)  -  (1/2) + 1</p><p>= 2 + (1/3)  -  (1/2)</p><p>= (12 + 2  -  3)/6 = 11/6</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Since A is an acute angle and secA = cosecA, therefore A = 45&deg;</p><p>Now,</p><p>2sin<sup>2</sup>A + [(tan<sup>2</sup>A)/3]  -  cos<sup>2</sup>A + 1</p><p>= 2sin<sup>2</sup>45&deg; + [(tan<sup>2</sup>45&deg;)/3]  -  cos<sup>2</sup>45&deg; + 1</p><p>= 2 * (1/2) + (1/3)  -  (1/2) + 1</p><p>= 2 + (1/3)  -  (1/2)</p><p>= (12 + 2  -  3)/6 = 11/6</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If sin A +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367;  sin A +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1", "options_en": ["837", "841", "839", "835"], "options_hi": ["837", "841", "839", "835"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>sinA + (1/sinA) = 29</p><p>sinA + cosecA = 29</p><p>Square both sides,</p><p>sin<sup>2</sup>A + cosec<sup>2</sup>A + 2 sinA cosecA = 841</p><p>sin<sup>2</sup>A + cosec<sup>2</sup>A = 841  -  2 = 839</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>sinA + (1/sinA) = 29</p><p>sinA + cosecA = 29</p><p>Square both sides,</p><p>sin<sup>2</sup>A + cosec<sup>2</sup>A + 2 sinA cosecA = 841</p><p>sin<sup>2</sup>A + cosec<sup>2</sup>A = 841  -  2 = 839</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the value of &#952;. If (&#960;/2 &lt; &#952; &lt; &#960;) and sin &#952; = 1/&radic;2.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (&#960;/2 &lt; &#952; &lt; &#960;) &#2324;&#2352; sin &#952; = 1/&radic;2 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#952; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;?</p>", "options_en": ["45&deg;", "150&deg;", "135&deg;", "120&deg;"], "options_hi": ["45&deg;", "150&deg;", "135&deg;", "120&deg;"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Given that,</p><p>sin&#952; = 1/&radic;2.</p><p>sin&#952; = sin 45</p><p>But given that (&#960;/2 &lt; &#952; &lt; &#960;),</p><p>So, sin&#952; = sin (&#960;  -  45)</p><p>sin&#952; = sin135</p><p>So, the value of &#952; = 135&deg;.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Given that,</p><p>sin&#952; = 1/&radic;2.</p><p>sin&#952; = sin 45</p><p>But given that (&#960;/2 &lt; &#952; &lt; &#960;),</p><p>So, sin&#952; = sin (&#960;  -  45)</p><p>sin&#952; = sin135</p><p>So, the value of &#952; = 135&deg;.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>What is the value of (sin 300&deg; x sin 240&deg;)  -  (tan 300&deg; x tan 240&deg;)</p>", "q_hi": "<p>(sin 300<sup>0</sup> x sin 240<sup>0</sup>) - (tan 300<sup>0</sup> x tan 240<sup>0</sup>) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["3", "2", "3.75", "2.75"], "options_hi": ["3", "2", "3.75", "2.75"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>(sin 300&deg; x sin 240&deg;)  -  (tan 300&deg; x tan 240&deg;)</p><p>= (sin (270&deg; +30&deg;) x sin (270&deg; - 30&deg;))- (tan (270&deg; + 30&deg;) x tan (270&deg; -30&deg;))</p><p>= ((-cos 30&deg;) x (-cos 30&deg;)  -  ((-cot 30&deg;) x (cot 30&deg;))</p><p>= cos<sup>2</sup> 30&deg;  -  (-cot<sup>2</sup> 30&deg;)</p><p>= (3/4) + 3 = 3.75</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>(sin 300&deg; x sin 240&deg;)  -  (tan 300&deg; x tan 240&deg;)</p><p>= (sin (270&deg; +30&deg;) x sin (270&deg; - 30&deg;))- (tan (270&deg; + 30&deg;) x tan (270&deg; -30&deg;))</p><p>= ((-cos 30&deg;) x (-cos 30&deg;)  -  ((-cot 30&deg;) x (cot 30&deg;))</p><p>= cos<sup>2</sup> 30&deg;  -  (-cot<sup>2</sup> 30&deg;)</p><p>= (3/4) + 3 = 3.75</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If sin&theta; = <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>8", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; sin&#952; = <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>8", "options_en": ["15/17", "8/15", "15/8", "17/15"], "options_hi": ["15/17", "8/15", "15/8", "17/15"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>sin&#1256; = 8/17</p><p>P = 8, H = 17</p><p>B = &radic; (17<sup>2</sup> - 8<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>B = 15</p><p>tan&#1256; = 8/15</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>sin&#1256; = 8/17</p><p>P = 8, H = 17</p><p>B = &radic; (17<sup>2</sup> - 8<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>B = 15</p><p>tan&#1256; = 8/15</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Simplify the following:</p><p><div>&nbsp;<div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>cosx - <span style='font-size: 19px;'>&radic;", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2352;&#2354;&#2368;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; : <div>&nbsp;<div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>cosx - <span style='font-size: 19px;'>&radic;", "options_en": ["cos(&#960;/3 - x)", "sin(&#960;/3 + x)", "cos(&#960;/3 + x)", "sin(&#960;/3 - x)"], "options_hi": ["cos(&#960;/3 - x)", "sin(&#960;/3 + x)", "cos(&#960;/3 + x)", "sin(&#960;/3 - x)"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p><img width=95 height=39 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20927/image061.png\"></p><p>= <img width=95 height=39 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20927/image062.png\"></p><p>= cos(x)cos(&#960;/3)  -  sin(x)sin(&#960;/3)</p><p>= cos(&#960;/3 + x)</p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=95 height=39 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20927/image061.png\"></p><p>= <img width=95 height=39 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20927/image062.png\"></p><p>= cos(x)cos(&#960;/3)  -  sin(x)sin(&#960;/3)</p><p>= cos(&#960;/3 + x)</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;Find the value of sec A if cot A =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">cosec A", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; cot A = cosec A/4 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; sec A &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["2", "-2", "4", "1/4"], "options_hi": ["2", "-2", "4", "1/4"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>cotA = cosecA/4</p><p>cosA/sinA = 1/4sinA</p><p>cosA = &#188;</p><p>secA = 4</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>cotA = cosecA/4</p><p>cosA/sinA = 1/4sinA</p><p>cosA = &#188;</p><p>secA = 4</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If sec (4x  -  40)&deg; = cosec (5x + 22)&deg;, then find the value of tan5x&deg;.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; sec (4x - 40) = cosec (5x + 22) &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; tan5x &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["&radic;3", "1/&radic;3", "1", "0"], "options_hi": ["&radic;3", "1/&radic;3", "1", "0"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>sec (4x  -  40)&deg; = cosec (5x + 22)&deg;</p><p>sec (4x  -  40) = sec (90  -  5x  -  22)</p><p>4x  -  40 = 90  -  5x  -  22</p><p>9x = 130  -  22</p><p>9x = 108</p><p>x = 12&deg;</p><p>Now,</p><p>tan5x = tan60 = &radic;3</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>sec (4x  -  40)&deg; = cosec (5x + 22)&deg;</p><p>sec (4x  -  40) = sec (90  -  5x  -  22)</p><p>4x  -  40 = 90  -  5x  -  22</p><p>9x = 130  -  22</p><p>9x = 108</p><p>x = 12&deg;</p><p>Now,</p><p>tan5x = tan60 = &radic;3</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If A lies in the first quadrant and 7 sin A = 3, then find the value of&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">14 cosec A - 9", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; A &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2375; &#2330;&#2340;&#2369;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2306;&#2358; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; 7 sin A = 3 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2344;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">14 cosec A - 9", "options_en": ["71/91", "77/89", "71/93", "77/89"], "options_hi": ["71/91", "77/89", "71/93", "77/89"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Given,</p><p>7sinA = 3</p><p>sinA = 3/7</p><p>Now,</p><p><img width=91 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image015.png\"></p><p><img width=143 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image016.png\"></p><p><img width=80 height=68 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image017.png\"></p><p><img width=68 height=52 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image018.png\"></p><p><img width=67 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image019.png\"></p><p><img width=35 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image020.png\"></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Given,</p><p>7sinA = 3</p><p>sinA = 3/7</p><p>Now,</p><p><img width=91 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image015.png\"></p><p><img width=143 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image016.png\"></p><p><img width=80 height=68 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image017.png\"></p><p><img width=68 height=52 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image018.png\"></p><p><img width=67 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image019.png\"></p><p><img width=35 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image020.png\"></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;Evaluate:&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">sec(34 + A)&deg; - cosec(56 - A)&deg;", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2360;&#2352;&#2354;&#2368;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2351;&#2375; :&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">sec(34 + A)&deg; - cosec(56 - A)&deg;", "options_en": ["1", "2", "0", "1/2"], "options_hi": ["1", "2", "0", "1/2"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p><img width=193 height=40 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image010.png\"></p><p><img width=229 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image011.png\"></p><p><img width=213 height=23 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image012.png\"></p><p><img width=25 height=17 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image013.png\"></p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=193 height=40 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image010.png\"></p><p><img width=229 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image011.png\"></p><p><img width=213 height=23 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image012.png\"></p><p><img width=25 height=17 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image013.png\"></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1  -  tan<sup>2</sup> (45&deg;  -  B)", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1  -  tan<sup>2</sup> (45&deg;  -  B)", "options_en": ["0", "1", "2", "3"], "options_hi": ["0", "1", "2", "3"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>[1  -  Tan<sup>2</sup>(45&deg;  -  B)]/[1 + Tan<sup>2</sup>(45&deg;  -  B)] = 1</p><p>1  -  Tan<sup>2</sup>(45&deg; -  B) = 1 + Tan<sup>2</sup>(45&deg;  -  B)</p><p>2Tan<sup>2</sup>(45&deg;  -  B) = 0</p><p>Tan(45&deg;  -  B) = 0 , Which is possible when (45&deg;  -  B) = 0</p><p>B = 45&deg;</p><p>Now the value of Sin2B = Sin(2 * 45&deg;) = Sin90&deg; = 1</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>[1  -  Tan<sup>2</sup>(45&deg;  -  B)]/[1 + Tan<sup>2</sup>(45&deg;  -  B)] = 1</p><p>1  -  Tan<sup>2</sup>(45&deg; -  B) = 1 + Tan<sup>2</sup>(45&deg;  -  B)</p><p>2Tan<sup>2</sup>(45&deg;  -  B) = 0</p><p>Tan(45&deg;  -  B) = 0 , Which is possible when (45&deg;  -  B) = 0</p><p>B = 45&deg;</p><p>Now the value of Sin2B = Sin(2 * 45&deg;) = Sin90&deg; = 1</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the value of 3cot<sup>2</sup>60&deg;  -  8sin<sup>2</sup>30&deg; + sec<sup>2</sup>120&deg;.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>3cot<sup>2</sup>60&deg; - 8sin<sup>2</sup>30&deg; + sec<sup>2</sup>120&deg; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["5", "3", "4", "2"], "options_hi": ["5", "3", "4", "2"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>3cot<sup>2</sup>60  -  8sin<sup>2</sup>30 + sec<sup>2</sup>120</p><p>= 3 * (1/&radic;3)<sup>2</sup>  -  8(1/2)<sup>2</sup> + sec<sup>2</sup>(90 + 30)</p><p>= 1  -  2 + (-cosec 30)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= -1 + 4</p><p>= 3</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>3cot<sup>2</sup>60  -  8sin<sup>2</sup>30 + sec<sup>2</sup>120</p><p>= 3 * (1/&radic;3)<sup>2</sup>  -  8(1/2)<sup>2</sup> + sec<sup>2</sup>(90 + 30)</p><p>= 1  -  2 + (-cosec 30)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= -1 + 4</p><p>= 3</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">13 cos A - 14 Sin A", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">13 cos A - 14 Sin A", "options_en": ["38/43", "37/31", "19/43", "16/31"], "options_hi": ["38/43", "37/31", "19/43", "16/31"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p><img width=139 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24241/image001.png\"></p><p><img width=111 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24241/image002.png\"></p><p><img width=177 height=17 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24241/image003.png\"></p><p><img width=85 height=17 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24241/image004.png\"></p><p><img width=72 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24241/image005.png\"></p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=139 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24241/image001.png\"></p><p><img width=111 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24241/image002.png\"></p><p><img width=177 height=17 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24241/image003.png\"></p><p><img width=85 height=17 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24241/image004.png\"></p><p><img width=72 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24241/image005.png\"></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If cos A +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; cos A +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1", "options_en": ["402", "388", "408", "398"], "options_hi": ["402", "388", "408", "398"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>cosA + (1/cosA) = 20</p><p>cosA + secA = 20</p><p>Square both sides,</p><p>cos<sup>2</sup>A + sec<sup>2</sup>A + 2 = 400</p><p>cos<sup>2</sup>A + sec<sup>2</sup>A = 398</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>cosA + (1/cosA) = 20</p><p>cosA + secA = 20</p><p>Square both sides,</p><p>cos<sup>2</sup>A + sec<sup>2</sup>A + 2 = 400</p><p>cos<sup>2</sup>A + sec<sup>2</sup>A = 398</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If the value of A + B =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">&pi;", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; A + B = <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">&pi;", "options_en": ["(1 + &radic;3)/2", "1", "0", "&radic;2"], "options_hi": ["(1 + &radic;3)/2", "1", "0", "&radic;2"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>sinA =<img width=24 height=39 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20637/image029.png\"> and A + B = <img width=15 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20637/image028.png\"></p><p>A= 60<sup>o</sup></p><p>So, B= 30<sup>o</sup></p><p>Now, sinB + cosB= sin30<sup>o</sup> + cos30<sup>o</sup></p><p>= <img width=49 height=39 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20637/image030.png\"></p><p>=(1 + &radic;3)/2</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>sinA =<img width=24 height=39 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20637/image029.png\"> and A + B = <img width=15 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20637/image028.png\"></p><p>A= 60<sup>o</sup></p><p>So, B= 30<sup>o</sup></p><p>Now, sinB + cosB= sin30<sup>o</sup> + cos30<sup>o</sup></p><p>= <img width=49 height=39 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20637/image030.png\"></p><p>=(1 + &radic;3)/2</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;In a triangle KLM, &#8736; M = 90&deg;, if cosec K = <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>13", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2319;&#2325; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332; KLM &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#8736; M = 90&deg; &#2324;&#2352; cosec K =<div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>13", "options_en": ["1/13", "12/13", "25/12", "1/12"], "options_hi": ["1/13", "12/13", "25/12", "1/12"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Cosec K = 13/5 = hypotenuse/perpendicular = KL/LM</p><p>By Pythagoras theorem,</p><p>Base = &radic; (169  -  25) = &radic;144 = 12 = KM</p><p>Now,</p><p>Cos K = base/hypotenuse = KM/KL = 12/13</p><p>Sin L = KM/KL = 12/13</p><p>Therefore,</p><p>[1  -  (12/13)]/ (12/13) = 1/12.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Cosec K = 13/5 = hypotenuse/perpendicular = KL/LM</p><p>By Pythagoras theorem,</p><p>Base = &radic; (169  -  25) = &radic;144 = 12 = KM</p><p>Now,</p><p>Cos K = base/hypotenuse = KM/KL = 12/13</p><p>Sin L = KM/KL = 12/13</p><p>Therefore,</p><p>[1  -  (12/13)]/ (12/13) = 1/12.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If Sin A =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">8", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; Sin A =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">8", "options_en": ["2<sup>1</sup>&frasl;<sub>120</sub>", "3<sup>1</sup>&frasl;<sub>120</sub>", "4<sup>1</sup>&frasl;<sub>120</sub>", "5<sup>1</sup>&frasl;<sub>120</sub>"], "options_hi": ["2<sup>1</sup>&#8260;<sub>120</sub>", "3<sup>1</sup>&#8260;<sub>120</sub>", "4<sup>1</sup>&#8260;<sub>120</sub>", "5<sup>1</sup>&#8260;<sub>120</sub>"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Sin A = 8/17</p><p>Cos A = &radic;(17<sup>2</sup>  -  8<sup>2</sup>)/17 = 15/17</p><p>Cot A = Cos A/Sin A = (15/17)/(8/17) = 15/8</p><p>Sec A = 1/Cos A = 1/(15/17) = 17/15</p><p>Now,</p><p>Cot A + Sec A</p><p>= 15/8 + 17/15</p><p>= (225 + 136)/120</p><p>= 361/120</p><p>= 3(1/120)</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Sin A = 8/17</p><p>Cos A = &radic;(17<sup>2</sup>  -  8<sup>2</sup>)/17 = 15/17</p><p>Cot A = Cos A/Sin A = (15/17)/(8/17) = 15/8</p><p>Sec A = 1/Cos A = 1/(15/17) = 17/15</p><p>Now,</p><p>Cot A + Sec A</p><p>= 15/8 + 17/15</p><p>= (225 + 136)/120</p><p>= 361/120</p><p>= 3(1/120)</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If secA + tanA = 10, then find the value of secA.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; secA + tanA = 10 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; secA &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["101/20", "91/10", "101/10", "91/20"], "options_hi": ["101/20", "91/10", "101/10", "91/20"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>secA + tanA = 10...(1)</p><p>We know that,</p><p>secA - tanA = 1/10...(2)</p><p>Adding equation (1) and (2),</p><p>2secA = 10 + (1/10)</p><p>2secA = 101/10</p><p>secA = 101/20</p><p></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>secA + tanA = 10...(1)</p><p>We know that,</p><p>secA - tanA = 1/10...(2)</p><p>Adding equation (1) and (2),</p><p>2secA = 10 + (1/10)</p><p>2secA = 101/10</p><p>secA = 101/20</p><p></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If cot A = <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>3", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; cot A = <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>3", "options_en": ["16/49", "9/49", "9/16", "16/9"], "options_hi": ["16/49", "9/49", "9/16", "16/9"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>cosec<sup>2</sup>A/sec<sup>2</sup>A</p><p>= cos<sup>2</sup>A/sin<sup>2</sup>A</p><p>= cot<sup>2</sup>A</p><p>= (3/7)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= 9/49</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>cosec<sup>2</sup>A/sec<sup>2</sup>A</p><p>= cos<sup>2</sup>A/sin<sup>2</sup>A</p><p>= cot<sup>2</sup>A</p><p>= (3/7)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= 9/49</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}]}